unters \u2014 Every dimension is different. Be ready for surprise challenges the moment you step through.\n\n\nGrow Fists Instantly \u2014 Temporarily amplify your strength and smash through the toughest obstacles with super-sized fists.\n\n\nCustomize Your Grabble \u2014 Stand out with unique looks, skins, and styles.\n\n\n\ud83c\udfae Play Your Way:\nSolo Campaign \u2014 Battle the glitches on your own.\n\n\nOnline Multiplayer \u2014 Team up with friends, combine powers, and clear dimensions together.\n", "short_description": "\ud83c\udf06 Grab Glide City: Embrace Chaos!\n\nGlide into Grab City, a once-thriving utopia now overtaken by disgusting glitch rust crystals emanating from unknown digi-dimensions. Swing and glide, and grab your way through the chaos with your Grabble! Join friends and Save the City! "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://outcre.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Outlandish Creative", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://outcre.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "31248559781401515"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2067069067503749"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2067069067503749"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_tim